# A course platform's turn stretches (PlatformSlowStretch, $83:CAA0, and
# PlatformTurnStretch, $83:CAB0), which no play reaches: on stage a1 s1
# the platforms of kind $47 run along the course's start, far below the
# turn stretches ($80:D2F8: x $0480-$057F and $0680-$077F). Record $12DB
# (one of them, slowing in PlatformSlowStretch) is put at x $0490, in the
# first stretch: its next step finds it in, it asks for a direction flip
# and waits at $83:CAAE. A frame on it is put at x $0590, past the
# stretch: its next step finds it out, it asks for a flip, starts its dip
# (sound $1E), faces 0 and waits at $83:CA9E again.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a1_s1.state
wait 30
poke 0012E7 90,04
wait 1
poke 0012E7 90,05
wait 1
dump c1
wait 10
